  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></math> be in arithmetic progression. Let the centroid of the triangle with vertices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is:",
